#requires -version 5.1
<#
    WinForensicX 2.0.0 — single-file build (read-only DFIR triage for Windows).
    Generated by tools/build.ps1. Do not edit by hand; edit the module and rebuild.

    Run directly for the interactive menu:   .\WinForensicX.ps1
    Run a triage straight away:               .\WinForensicX.ps1 -RunTriage
    Show help / commands / limitations:       .\WinForensicX.ps1 -Help
    Load the functions into a session:        . .\WinForensicX.ps1   (then call Invoke-WfxTriage, etc.)

    Defensive tool: credential exposure is audited and REDACTED (type + length only).
    It never extracts, decrypts or dumps secrets, hashes, memory or credential stores.
#>
param([switch]$RunTriage, [switch]$Menu, [switch]$Help, [string]$OutputPath = '', [switch]$NoAuto)

